   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Determine whether the graph is the graph of a function.\n<figure><img src=\"exercises/media/fa3a16e1b560b378.jpg\" alt=\"An ellipse is plotted on an x y coordinate plane. The x and y axes range from negative 6 to 6, in increments of 1. The center of the ellipse is at (0, 0). The ellipse passes through the points, (negative 2, 0), (0, 3), (2, 0), and (0, negative 3).\"></figure>",
